  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN245.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">poruḷkaṭaikkūṭṭiya neñciṟkut talaimakaṉ collic celavaḻuṅkiyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How HE spoke to [his] heart that coveted wealth [and] prevented [their] going.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN245.1">
        <l>uyiriṉuñ ciṟanta voṇporu ṭarumār</l>
        <l>naṉṟupuri kāṭciyar ceṉṟaṉa ravareṉa</l>
        <l>maṉaivalit toḻiyu matukaiya <supplied>ḷā</supplied>ta</l>
        <l><supplied>ṉī</supplied>naṟ kaṟintaṉai yāyi ṉīṅki</l>
        <l>maḻai<supplied>peya</supplied>ṉ maṟanta ka<supplied>ḻai</supplied>tiraṅ ki<supplied>ya</supplied>viṟ</l>
        <l>celcāt teṟiyum <supplied>paṇ</supplied>pil vāḻkkai</l>
        <l>valvi liḷaiyar talaiva relluṟa</l>
        <l>varikiḷar paṇaittōḷ vayiṟaṇi titalai</l>
        <l>yariya lāṭṭiya ralkumaṉai varaippiṉ</l>
        <l>makiḻ<supplied>no</supplied>ṭai peṟāa ṉāki naṉaikavuṭ</l>
        <l>kāṉa yāṉai veṇkōṭu cuṭṭi</l>
        <l>maṉṟōṭu putalvaṉ <supplied>pu</supplied>ṉṟalai nīvu</l>
        <l>marumuṉaip pākkat talki vaikuṟa</l>
        <l>niḻalpaṭak kaviṉṟa nīḷarai yilavat</l>
        <l>taḻalakain taṉṉa valaṅkuciṉai yoṇpūk</l>
        <l>kuḻalicait tumpi yārkku māṅkaṭ</l>
        <l>kuṟumpoṟai yuṇaṅkun tatarveḷ ḷeṉpu</l>
        <l>kaṭuṅkāl vēṭṭat talkupaci tīrkkuṅ</l>
        <l>kaṉṉaṭu kavalaiya kāṉa nīnti</l>
        <l>yammā varivai yoḻiyac</l>
        <l>ceṉmō neñcam vāraleṉ yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="4a-c">If you have understood well</l>
        <l corresp="3">that she will be one who has the strength to stay at home by force,</l>
        <l corresp="2">thinking “he has gone, he with a view to doing good,</l>
        <l corresp="1">in order to bring bright wealth that is superior to life”,</l>
        <l rend="indent5" corresp="4d">[then] leave,</l>
        <l corresp="13a-c">stay in villages on the difficult frontier,</l>
        <l corresp="7a-c">where the leader of the young warriors with strong bows</l>
        <l corresp="6">with the unworthy livelihood of attacking the caravans that go</l>
        <l corresp="5">on the way where the bamboo dried up on which the clouds forgot to rain,</l>
        <l corresp="7d 10a-c">when night falls, as one who does not [even] get the price of toddy</l>
        <l corresp="9">within the bounds of the house where the toddy[-selling] women stay,</l>
        <l corresp="8">[their] bamboo shoulders shining with lines, beauty spots adorning [their] bellies,</l>
        <l corresp="10d-11">points to the white tusk of the forest elephant with wet temple</l>
        <l corresp="12">[and] strokes the ruddy head of a boy who runs in the village common,</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="13d">[and] when it dawns</l>
        <l corresp="19">cross the forest with crossroads in the midst of the stones,</l>
        <l corresp="16">where, in that place where the bees hum flute music</l>
        <l corresp="15">on the bright flowers of the swaying branches that sprouted like fire</l>
        <l corresp="14">on the silkcotton tree with a tall trunk that is made beautiful so that shade falls,</l>
        <l corresp="17">crushed white bones that dry on the low hillock</l>
        <l corresp="18">still the lingering hunger of the swift-footed hunt,</l>
        <l corresp="20">– so that [our] pretty dark girl remains behind,</l>
        <l corresp="21">go, heart, I will not come.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

